## Identity providers

`identity_providers` defaults to `builtin`, which every MinIO server serves.

Add `ldap` or `openid` only when the server runs them. MinIO answers a listing
request for an identity provider it does not run with an error rather than an
empty list, so asking for one unconditionally makes the plan fail on servers
that do not have it.

